>Statement (I)</strong> : p-nitrophenol is more acidic than m-nitrophenol and o-nitrophenol.</p><p><strong>Statement (II)</strong> : Ethanol will give immediate turbidity with Lucas reagent.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "285ea9", "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae0"}, {"id": "3bb25e", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae1"}, {"id": "e2d71f", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae2"}, {"id": "862d66", "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae3"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae4", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfae9"], "topics": ["60e5678e499d1e49588f927e"], "concepts": ["60e5678c499d1e49588f9262"], "question": {"text": "The major product of the following reaction is:\n\n<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2FVy5B9RnXHjs33cV1Sl91Dpt49euFJppU5IHnjlK2fO8.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"><br>"}, "options": [{"id": "7fb22b", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2FtkjfrP4eXU_BDYAhxHnxAsADCpVXmyAxaL4XZEQeHx4.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"><br>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae5"}, {"id": "9382f3", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2FenvJhJ9wlYFy3fV606Vsb2bfwXWiIlD7XVYEflDvM8w.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"><br>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f4d5dcf815cd79dbae6"}, {"id": "d3ff9d", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.google